{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Normed","lean:module:QOU.Mass.ConstantKernelGrowthBound"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential.not_isConstKernelRec_of_factorial_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential.not_isConstKernelRec_of_factorial_le","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/FactorialSuperExponential.lean#L89-L94","doc":"**Composition with #6101's theorem.** No depth-`d` constant-kernel recurrence\nadmits a solution growing at least factorially on its even subsequence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential.superExponential_of_factorial_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.FactorialSuperExponential.superExponential_of_factorial_le","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/FactorialSuperExponential.lean#L55-L87","doc":"**Factorial growth on the even subsequence implies super-exponential\ngrowth.** Stated against #6101's `SuperExponential`, so it composes directly\nwith `not_isConstKernelRec_of_superExponential`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}